{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54574","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，雾气昼昏昏（京本作「纷纷」）。\n一（辛本、川本、京本作「欲」）似露来兼洒（京本作「雾来兼似」）雨，此爲天泣泪（京本作「血」）纷纷，须驻（京本作「驻泊」）赏三军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}